      "author": "inumanag",
      "created_at": "2024-01-29T19:41:31Z",
      "body": "You cannot unpack lists in Codon, unfortunately, as list length is not known at compile time; you can only unpack tuples. You need to either cast list to tuple or have an arbitrary way to pass lists to functions.\r\n\r\nThis limitation won't go away; it is intrinsic to Codon's static compilation approach."
    }
  ]
